        {
          "text": "Nibaleerela abaana baIsiraeli amakhuwa amabii khushialo eshia bali nibaluurile bari Eshialo eshia khwalambuula nikhuluuranga neshialo eshilia bulia abamenyangamwo; nabandu bosi aba khwalolamwo bali abasaatsa abakhongo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
